 "stimulus_html": "<p>For each equation in questions 11 - 14, use the following scenario.</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>Jada looks at Mai's work and is confused. She doesn't see how Mai got her answer.</p>\n  <p>Complete Mai's missing steps by answering the questions to help Jada see how Mai solved the equation.</p>\n\n<p><span data-math=\"x^2+12x=13\">x^2+12x=13</span></p>\n<p><strong>Step 1 - </strong><span data-math=\"x^2\\;+\\;12x\\; +\">x^2\\;+\\;12x\\; +</span> <span data-math=\"\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\">\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_</span> <span data-math=\"=\\;13\\;+\">=\\;13\\;+</span> <span data-math=\"\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\">\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_</span></p>\n<p><strong>Step 2 -</strong> <span data-math=\"(x+6)^2=49\">(x+6)^2=49</span></p>\n<p><strong>Step 3 - </strong><span data-math=\"\\sqrt{(x+6)^2}=\\sqrt{49}\">\\sqrt{(x+6)^2}=\\sqrt{49}</span></p>\n<p><strong>Step 4 -</strong> <span data-math=\"x+6= \\pm\">x+6= \\pm</span> <span data-math=\"\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\">\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_</span></p>\n<p><strong>Step 5 - </strong><span data-math=\"x+6=\">x+6=</span> <span data-math=\"\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\">\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_</span></p>\n<p><strong>Step 6 -</strong> <span data-math=\"x\\;+\\;6=\">x\\;+\\;6=</span> <span data-math=\"-\">-</span> <span data-math=\"\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\">\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_</span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"x=1\">x=1</span> or <span data-math=\"x=-13\">x=-13</span></p>\n</blockquote>\n <br>",
